A small and simple nodejs server that purely reads and writes random strings to and sql database.
These random strings are split up accross languages with each language coming from a seperate database.
it constantly writes at configurable intervals.
Starting the stats page is also configurable.
It serves a page that shows the current count of strings in each database along with the first and last string.
It also prints out database response time along with other useful statistics.
its a very small number of lines.
We only use pnpm.